{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49080","headline":"浣溪沙 · 南唐嗣主李璟","name":"浣溪沙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风压轻云贴水飞，乍晴池馆燕争泥，沈郎多病不胜衣。\n沙上未闻鸿雁信，竹间时听鹧鸪啼，此情惟有落花知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"南唐嗣主李璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}